{
  "description": "The creature is a large quadrupedal mammal shown in right-facing profile against a plain light background, standing on a flat surface. Its overall body shape, fur, head, and limbs resemble a brown bear, covered in dense, shaggy brown fur that is darker on the back and legs and creamy off-white on the chest, throat and underside. Embedded in the fur are multiple glossy, hard-looking dark reddish-brown to black plates resembling beetle exoskeleton, distributed along the back, flank, shoulder, neck, and leg joints. A single large glossy black curved horn with small tines projects upward from the forehead. The animal stands on four thick legs ending in clawed paws, with a very short stubby tail at the rear.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "bear-like, broad with a tapered muzzle, black nose at the tip, small dark eye in profile, closed mouth, covered in brown fur with a lighter tan muzzle and darker shading around the eye",
      "where": "at the right end of the body, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "horns",
      "looks_like": "single large glossy black horn curving upward and backward, with several small pointed tines along the inner curve and a thick bulbous base fused to the forehead fur",
      "where": "on the center of the forehead, projecting dorsally from the head"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two small rounded ears covered in dense fluffy brown fur",
      "where": "on top of the head behind the horn"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick columnar heavily furred legs covered in long brown fur, with glossy dark brown joint plates and segmented connectors visible at the shoulders, elbows and knees",
      "where": "supporting the body ventrally, two forelegs under the chest and two hindlegs under the hips"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four broad flat paws with blunt light-colored claws protruding from the fur at the toe tips",
      "where": "at the distal ends of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "very short stubby tuft of brown fur",
      "where": "at the extreme left rear of the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "plates",
      "looks_like": "multiple glossy hard chitinous plates in dark reddish-brown to black: a large irregular spiky plate on the shoulder/neck, a large elongated ridged elytra-like plate on the mid-flank, several smaller triangular and oval plates on the back and rump, small oval hole-like structures in a row along the lower flank and neck, and small rounded plates with dark segmented bands at the leg joints and ankles",
      "where": "distributed over the dorsal back, lateral flank, shoulder, ventral neck, lower side, and around all four leg joints"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "natural fur color gradation with no spots or stripes: dark brown dorsally and on the limbs, lighter creamy off-white ventrally on the chest, throat and belly, with subtle shading in the fur",
      "where": "covering the entire body, lighter ventrally and darker dorsally"
    }
  ],
